README for JNA

URL: https://github.com/java-native-access/jna
Downloaded From:
  https://search.maven.org/artifact/net.java.dev.jna/jna/5.17.0/jar
  https://search.maven.org/artifact/net.java.dev.jna/jna-platform/5.17.0/jar
Bumped from 5.6.0 to 5.17.0: 5.6.0 predates darwin-aarch64 support entirely (added in 5.7.0),
so an arm64 JVM cannot load its native dispatch library at all.
